## UI/UX 设计系统 (蓝白配色 · 医学影像专业风格)

### 设计理念

XQ 采用 **蓝白配色** 的专业医学影像界面风格，参考 SimVascular 的实际 QSS 样式表，结合现代 UI/UX 最佳实践。风格定位：**Swiss Minimalism + Accessible & Ethical**，即瑞士极简主义配合医疗级可访问性标准。

**核心原则：**
- 清晰的视觉层次：蓝色为主色调表达专业与信任，白色背景保证内容可读性
- 功能优先：每个 UI 元素服务于医学影像工作流（Path → Seg → Model → Mesh → Sim）
- 高对比度：所有文本满足 WCAG AA 标准（≥4.5:1 对比度）
- 一致性：统一的间距系统（8dp 基准）、统一的圆角和阴影规则

### 色彩系统 (Color Palette)

#### 主色板 (Primary Palette)

| 角色 | 色值 | CSS 变量 | 用途说明 |
|------|------|----------|----------|
| **Primary Blue** | `#0047B3` | `--xq-primary` | 图标主色、品牌色、重要操作按钮 |
| **Primary Light** | `#1C97EA` | `--xq-primary-light` | 选中状态、工具箱高亮、活跃标签 |
| **Primary Hover** | `#00CCFF` | `--xq-primary-hover` | 菜单悬停、列表项悬停高亮 |
| **Background Blue** | `#E6F2FF` | `--xq-bg-blue` | 菜单栏背景、工具栏背景、编辑面板背景 |
| **Background White** | `#FFFFFF` | `--xq-bg-white` | 卡片背景、内容区域、对话框 |
| **Background Gray** | `#F8FAFC` | `--xq-bg-gray` | 主窗口底色、禁用区域 |
| **Text Primary** | `#0F172A` | `--xq-text-primary` | 主要文本（标题、标签） |
| **Text Secondary** | `#64748B` | `--xq-text-secondary` | 次要文本（说明、提示） |
| **Border** | `#E2E8F0` | `--xq-border` | 普通分割线、面板边框 |
| **Border Active** | `#3F3F46` | `--xq-border-active` | 工具栏边框、工具箱边框 |

#### 语义色板 (Semantic Colors)

| 角色 | 色值 | 用途说明 |
|------|------|----------|
| **Success** | `#16A34A` | 操作成功提示、健康状态 |
| **Warning** | `#D97706` | 警告提示、参数超限 |
| **Error/Destructive** | `#DC2626` | 错误提示、删除操作、危急报警 |
| **Info** | `#0891B2` | 信息提示、加载状态 |

#### 渲染视口配色 (Viewport Colors)

| 角色 | 色值 | 用途说明 |
|------|------|----------|
| **Path 路径** | `#FF6600` | 路径曲线和控制点（SimVascular 默认） |
| **Contour 轮廓** | `#00FF00` | 分割轮廓线 |
| **Model 模型** | `#CCCCCC` | 3D 模型表面（半透明灰） |
| **Mesh 网格** | `#6699CC` | 网格线框显示 |
| **Selection** | `#FFFF00` | 选中高亮 |

### 主窗口渐变背景

SimVascular 使用 `QMainWindow` 渐变背景作为视觉标识：
```css
QMainWindow {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:0, y2:1,
        stop:0 #CCE0FF, stop:1 #E6F2FF);
}
```
XQ 采用类似的蓝白渐变，从上方的浅蓝色 `#CCE0FF` 过渡到底部的极浅蓝 `#E6F2FF`，营造专业医学软件的视觉氛围。

### QSS 样式表规范 (xq.qss)

XQ 的完整 QSS 样式表定义。此文件为 MITK 框架解析，`iconColor` 和 `iconAccentColor` 注释行由 MITK 主题引擎自动读取：

```css
/*
  iconColor       = #0047B3 <- This line is parsed by MITK
  iconAccentColor = #FFFFFF <- This line is parsed by MITK
*/

/* ===== 菜单栏 ===== */
QMenuBar {
    background: #E6F2FF;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #CCE0FF;
    padding: 2px 0;
}

QMenuBar::item {
    background: transparent;
    color: #0F172A;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: 2px;
}

QMenuBar::item:selected {
    background: #00CCFF;
    color: #FFFFFF;
}

QMenuBar::item:pressed {
    background: #1C97EA;
    color: #FFFFFF;
}

/* ===== 下拉菜单 ===== */
QMenu {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 4px 0;
}

QMenu::item {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: #0F172A;
    padding: 8px 32px 8px 16px;
}

QMenu::item:selected {
    background-color: #E6F2FF;
    color: #0047B3;
}

QMenu::item:disabled {
    color: #94A3B8;
}

QMenu::separator {
    height: 1px;
    background: #E2E8F0;
    margin: 4px 8px;
}

/* ===== 工具栏 ===== */
QToolBar {
    background: #E6F2FF;
    border: 1px solid #CCE0FF;
    border-radius: 6px;
    spacing: 4px;
    padding: 2px;
}

QToolBar::separator {
    width: 1px;
    background: #CCE0FF;
    margin: 4px 2px;
}

QToolButton {
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    color: #0F172A;
}

QToolButton:hover {
    background: #CCE0FF;
}

QToolButton:pressed {
    background: #1C97EA;
    color: #FFFFFF;
}

QToolButton:checked {
    background: #0047B3;
    color: #FFFFFF;
}

/* ===== BlueBerry Tab Bar ===== */
berry--QCTabBar::tab {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    min-height: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-left: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    color: #64748B;
}

berry--QCTabBar::tab:only-one {
    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
    background-color: #E6F2FF;
    min-height: 28px;
}

berry--QCTabBar::tab:first {
    border-left: none;
    border-radius: 8px 0 0 0;
}

berry--QCTabBar::tab:last {
    border-right: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 0 8px 0 0;
}

berry--QCTabBar::tab:selected {
    background-color: #E6F2FF;
    border: 2px solid #1C97EA;
    border-bottom: none;
    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
    color: #0047B3;
    font-weight: bold;
}

berry--QCTabBar QToolButton {
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    max-height: 22px;
}

berry--QCTabBar QToolButton#TabCloseButton {
    border: none;
    background: none;
}

berry--QCTabBar QToolButton#TabCloseButton:hover {
    background: #FEE2E2;
    border-radius: 3px;
}

/* ===== 工具箱 ===== */
QToolBox::tab {
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: #F8FAFC;
    color: #0F172A;
}

QToolBox::tab:hover {
    background-color: #E6F2FF;
}

QToolBox::tab:selected {
    background-color: #1C97EA;
    border: 1px solid #1C97EA;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* ===== 主窗口 ===== */
QMainWindow {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:0, y2:1,
        stop:0 #CCE0FF, stop:1 #E6F2FF);
}

/* ===== 编辑面板 ===== */
QWidget#xqPluginEditWindow {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 6px;
}

/* ===== 视图表单 ===== */
QWidget#StandaloneViewForm {
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 4px;
}

QFrame#ViewFormContentFrame {
    border: 2px solid #1C97EA;
    border-radius: 4px;
}

/* ===== 滚动条 ===== */
QScrollBar:vertical {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    width: 10px;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical {
    background: #CCE0FF;
    border-radius: 5px;
    min-height: 30px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover {
    background: #1C97EA;
}

QScrollBar:horizontal {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:horizontal {
    background: #CCE0FF;
    border-radius: 5px;
    min-width: 30px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:horizontal:hover {
    background: #1C97EA;
}

/* ===== 树视图 (Data Manager) ===== */
QTreeView {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    alternate-background-color: #F8FAFC;
    selection-background-color: #E6F2FF;
    selection-color: #0047B3;
}

QTreeView::item {
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border: none;
}

QTreeView::item:hover {
    background: #E6F2FF;
}

QTreeView::item:selected {
    background: #CCE0FF;
    color: #0047B3;
}

QTreeView::branch:has-children:!has-siblings:closed,
QTreeView::branch:closed:has-children:has-siblings {
    border-image: none;
}

/* ===== 按钮 ===== */
QPushButton {
    background: #0047B3;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QPushButton:hover {
    background: #1C97EA;
}

QPushButton:pressed {
    background: #003D99;
}

QPushButton:disabled {
    background: #94A3B8;
    color: #E2E8F0;
}

QPushButton[flat="true"] {
    background: transparent;
    color: #0047B3;
    border: 1px solid #0047B3;
}

QPushButton[flat="true"]:hover {
    background: #E6F2FF;
}

/* ===== 输入框 ===== */
QLineEdit, QSpinBox, QDoubleSpinBox, QComboBox {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    color: #0F172A;
    selection-background-color: #CCE0FF;
}

QLineEdit:focus, QSpinBox:focus, QDoubleSpinBox:focus, QComboBox:focus {
    border: 2px solid #1C97EA;
}

QLineEdit:disabled, QSpinBox:disabled, QDoubleSpinBox:disabled {
    background: #F1F5F9;
    color: #94A3B8;
}

/* ===== 分组框 ===== */
QGroupBox {
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #0047B3;
}

QGroupBox::title {
    subcontrol-origin: margin;
    subcontrol-position: top left;
    padding: 0 8px;
    color: #0047B3;
}

/* ===== 状态栏 ===== */
QStatusBar {
    background: #E6F2FF;
    border-top: 1px solid #CCE0FF;
    color: #0F172A;
}

QStatusBar::item {
    border: none;
}

/* ===== 进度条 ===== */
QProgressBar {
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #F8FAFC;
}

QProgressBar::chunk {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:0,
        stop:0 #0047B3, stop:1 #1C97EA);
    border-radius: 4px;
}

/* ===== 表格 ===== */
QTableView, QTableWidget {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    alternate-background-color: #F8FAFC;
    selection-background-color: #E6F2FF;
    selection-color: #0047B3;
    gridline-color: #E2E8F0;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
}

QHeaderView::section {
    background: #E6F2FF;
    color: #0047B3;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border: none;
    border-right: 1px solid #CCE0FF;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #1C97EA;
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* ===== 滑块 ===== */
QSlider::groove:horizontal {
    height: 4px;
    background: #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 2px;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    margin: -6px 0;
    background: #0047B3;
    border-radius: 8px;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal:hover {
    background: #1C97EA;
}

QSlider::sub-page:horizontal {
    background: #1C97EA;
    border-radius: 2px;
}

/* ===== 复选框 & 单选框 ===== */
QCheckBox::indicator, QRadioButton::indicator {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked {
    background: #0047B3;
    border: 2px solid #0047B3;
    border-radius: 3px;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:unchecked {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 3px;
}

QRadioButton::indicator:checked {
    background: #0047B3;
    border: 2px solid #0047B3;
    border-radius: 9px;
}

/* ===== 工具提示 ===== */
QToolTip {
    background: #0F172A;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
}

/* ===== DockWidget ===== */
QDockWidget {
    titlebar-close-icon: none;
    titlebar-normal-icon: none;
}

QDockWidget::title {
    background: #E6F2FF;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #1C97EA;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #0047B3;
}

/* ===== Splitter ===== */
QSplitter::handle {
    background: #CCE0FF;
}

QSplitter::handle:horizontal {
    width: 3px;
}

QSplitter::handle:vertical {
    height: 3px;
}

QSplitter::handle:hover {
    background: #1C97EA;
}
```

