## Phase 2: 应用核心插件 (org.xq.gui.qt.application)

### Task 2.1: 应用入口 main.cxx

**Files:**
- Create: `~/XQ/Code/Source/Application/CMakeLists.txt`
- Create: `~/XQ/Code/Source/Application/main.cxx`

**main.cxx 架构:**

```cpp
// main.cxx — XQ 应用入口
#include <QApplication>
#include "xq_Main.h"

int main(int argc, char *argv[])
{
    // 解析命令行参数
    bool use_gui = true;

    for (int i = 1; i < argc; i++) {
        if (strcmp(argv[i], "--help") == 0 || strcmp(argv[i], "-h") == 0) {
            fprintf(stdout, "XQ Medical Imaging Software\n");
            fprintf(stdout, "  -h, --help    : print help\n");
            fprintf(stdout, "  --qt-gui      : launch Qt GUI (default)\n");
            return 0;
        }
    }

    if (use_gui) {
        return xqMain(argc, argv);
    }
    return 0;
}
```

**CMakeLists.txt:**

```cmake
project(xq_application)

add_executable(xq main.cxx)

target_link_libraries(xq PRIVATE
    org_xq_gui_qt_application
    ${MITK_LIBRARIES}
    Qt6::Widgets
    Qt6::Core
)
```

